# What the source distribution carries beyond the package itself.
#
# The wheel takes its long description from README.md through pyproject, and PyPI
# renders that; the CHANGELOG had no route into either artefact at all. Someone who
# downloads the sdist should be able to read what changed without leaving the file
# they downloaded, so it is included here — and the `Changelog` project URL in
# pyproject keeps the link in PyPI's sidebar for everyone else.
include README.md
include CHANGELOG.md
include LICENSE
